<Base title="Privacy Policy" description="What information FreelanceStack collects and how it is used.">
  <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p class="date">Last updated: October 29, 2026</p>

  <h2>What this site collects</h2>
  <p>FreelanceStack has no accounts, comments or sign-up forms, and I do not ask visitors for personal information. If you email me, I receive your email address and your message, and I use them only to reply.</p>

  <h2>Hosting and technical data</h2>
  <p>The site is hosted by Vercel. Hosting providers may automatically log technical data such as IP address, browser type and the pages requested, in order to deliver and secure the site.</p>

  <h2>Search tools</h2>
  <p>I use Google Search Console to see how the site appears in Google Search. It reports search information about the site, not about individual visitors.</p>

  <h2>Affiliate links and third-party sites</h2>
  <p>Some links are affiliate links. When you click one, the company or its affiliate network may set cookies in your browser to record that you came from this site. Those companies have their own privacy policies, which apply once you leave this site.</p>

  <h2>Your choices</h2>
  <p>You can block or delete cookies in your browser settings. To ask about information you have sent me, use the <a href="/contact">contact page</a>.</p>

  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>If this policy changes, the date above will be updated.</p>
</Base>
